{"id":2305,"date":"2024-09-19T12:34:11","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:34:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2305"},"modified":"2025-10-02T12:19:03","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T12:19:03","slug":"cardboard-sandwich-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-sandwich-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Sandwich Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Logo-Printed Sandwich Boxes to Promote Your Brand<\/h2>\n<p>Cardboard Sandwich Boxes are designed to keep sandwiches fresh, presentable, and easy to carry. Businesses looking for consistent packaging often also explore <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-snack-boxes\/\">Cardboard Snack Boxes<\/a><\/strong> to match their sandwich containers with other food packaging needs. Our sandwich boxes come in durable paperboard that is food-safe and grease-resistant, ensuring that your product remains intact during transport and serving.<\/p>\n<h3>Why sandwich packaging is important<\/h3>\n<p>Sandwiches require packaging that prevents leaks and maintains freshness. Our boxes provide a sturdy structure with customization options for sizes and printing. These boxes are widely used in fast-food outlets, catering services, and bakeries.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Material and Features of Sandwich Boxes<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Options Available<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Material<\/td>\n<td>Food-grade cardboard and kraft<\/td>\n<td>White SBS, Kraft, Recycled stocks<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing<\/td>\n<td>High-quality logo and branding prints<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Digital, Offset<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finishing<\/td>\n<td>Coating for durability and look<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Styles<\/td>\n<td>Secure and easy-to-handle structures<\/td>\n<td>Die-cut, Window-style, Hinged lids<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Key benefits of cardboard sandwich boxes<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Keeps sandwiches fresh and prevents leakage.<\/li>\n<li>Custom printing improves shelf appeal.<\/li>\n<li>Durable build for takeaway and catering services.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Custom Printed Sandwich Boxes for Branding<\/h2>\n<p>Branded packaging helps your food business stand out. Many restaurants and catering companies also consider <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Food-Related-Cardboard-Boxes\/\">Food-Related Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> to maintain uniformity across all their menu items. Custom printing allows you to add logos, product details, and attractive designs that enhance presentation and customer trust.<\/p>\n<h3>Printing styles and flexibility<\/h3>\n<p>We offer flexible printing options such as digital, offset, and screen printing. Whether you want bold colors or simple branding, our technology ensures sharp and professional output.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Printing Styles and Sizes<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Printing Style<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Best Use Case<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Digital Printing<\/td>\n<td>High-resolution small batch printing<\/td>\n<td>Startups, caf\u00e9s, low MOQ orders<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Offset Printing<\/td>\n<td>Consistent large batch production<\/td>\n<td>Wholesale and retail suppliers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Screen Printing<\/td>\n<td>Strong bold colors and graphics<\/td>\n<td>Catering, branding promotions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Size Options<\/td>\n<td>Small, Medium, Large, Custom sizes<\/td>\n<td>Sandwiches, wraps, rolls, subs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Why custom sandwich packaging helps<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Boosts retail display visibility.<\/li>\n<li>Allows detailed brand communication.<\/li>\n<li>Improves customer confidence in hygiene.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Eco-Friendly Sandwich Box Packaging<\/h2>\n<p>At <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong>, we provide sustainable sandwich box packaging solutions. Our cardboard boxes are recyclable, biodegradable, and made from FSC-certified paper, helping businesses reduce their environmental impact while maintaining product quality.<\/p>\n<h3>Why eco-friendly matters in catering<\/h3>\n<p>Customers today demand greener packaging options. By using recyclable paperboard, you can cut down plastic usage and promote a positive brand image. Eco-friendly sandwich boxes also appeal to health-conscious customers in catering and retail.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Eco-Friendly Features of Sandwich Boxes<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Recyclability<\/td>\n<td>100% recyclable cardboard<\/td>\n<td>Easy disposal and environmental care<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Biodegradability<\/td>\n<td>Natural breakdown without harm<\/td>\n<td>Reduces landfill waste<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FSC Certified Paper<\/td>\n<td>Responsible sourcing materials<\/td>\n<td>Builds consumer trust<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Safe Food Contact<\/td>\n<td>Complies with hygiene standards<\/td>\n<td>Keeps sandwiches fresh and safe<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Green packaging advantages<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Aligns your brand with sustainability.<\/li>\n<li>Reduces reliance on single-use plastics.<\/li>\n<li>Meets global eco-packaging demands.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Bulk and Wholesale Supply of Sandwich Boxes<\/h2>\n<p>Large-scale food businesses save money by ordering <strong>Cardboard Sandwich Boxes wholesale<\/strong>. Bulk supply ensures you always have stock available for catering events, restaurants, and daily food service operations.<\/p>\n<h3>Why wholesale is the smart choice<\/h3>\n<p>Buying in bulk lowers per-unit costs and guarantees consistent print and design quality. This option is suitable for caf\u00e9s, bakeries, and catering companies.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Wholesale and Delivery Details<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Option<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Minimum Order Quantity<\/td>\n<td>Starts at 100 Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Standard Production<\/td>\n<td>7\u201310 Business Days<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rush Orders<\/td>\n<td>Available upon request<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free shipping on bulk purchases<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Wholesale benefits for businesses<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Cost-saving for catering and restaurants.<\/li>\n<li>Fast turnaround time for urgent events.<\/li>\n<li>Free mockups provided before final printing.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Sandwich Boxes for Catering and Takeaway<\/h2>\n<p>Large cardboard sandwich boxes are widely used in catering services, food delivery, and events. They are practical, hygienic, and designed for easy handling. These disposable lunch boxes are available in multiple sizes, making them ideal for sandwiches, wraps, and snacks.<\/p>\n<h3>Why catering prefers cardboard lunch boxes<\/h3>\n<p>Cardboard lunch boxes for catering are lightweight yet durable. They offer easy stacking, fast service handling, and secure packaging for food items.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Catering and Event Use Cases<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Catering Need<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Box Type<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Sandwich Catering<\/td>\n<td>Large cardboard sandwich boxes<\/td>\n<td>Keeps food presentable and hygienic<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Takeaway Service<\/td>\n<td>Disposable lunch boxes<\/td>\n<td>Convenient and cost-effective<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Event Packaging<\/td>\n<td>Sandwich box container with window<\/td>\n<td>Improves food visibility and freshness<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Corporate Lunches<\/td>\n<td>Cardboard lunch boxes with logo<\/td>\n<td>Enhances brand presentation<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Key reasons catering chooses these boxes<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Easy distribution at events and offices.<\/li>\n<li>Keeps sandwiches secure during transport.<\/li>\n<li>Branding opportunity through printing.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Durable Sandwich Packaging for Daily Use<\/h2>\n<p>Sandwich Box Containers are used by caf\u00e9s, supermarkets, and catering companies for safe delivery. These boxes combine quality, branding, and eco-friendliness. With multiple finishing options like gloss, matte, and Spot UV, businesses can select the right style that suits their identity.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Final Detailed Features<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Category<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Range<\/td>\n<td>Small to large sandwich containers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Options<\/td>\n<td>Logo, branding, QR codes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finishing Choices<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Usage<\/td>\n<td>Retail, catering, takeaway services<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>Sandwich Bags and cardboard boxes together make an effective solution for food packaging. They provide a professional look while ensuring food safety. With disposable lunch boxes in bulk, food suppliers can achieve cost-efficiency and maintain consistent standards.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for high-quality cardboard sandwich boxes at wholesale prices. Our boxes are made from durable materials and are perfect for packaging sandwiches, salads, and other snacks. We also offer fast turnaround times and free design and shipping.\u00a0Enjoy fast turnaround times and superior printing options with every order. Contact us today.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2430,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[183],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2305","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-food-related-cardboard-boxes","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Buy Custom Cardboard Sandwich Boxes And Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Premium cardboard sandwich boxes, ideal for takeaways and picnics. Eco-friendly and durable packaging for delicious meals on the go.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-sandwich-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Buy Custom Cardboard Sandwich Boxes And Packaging\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Premium cardboard sandwich boxes, ideal for takeaways and picnics. Eco-friendly and durable packaging for delicious meals on the go.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-sandwich-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-02T12:19:03+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Cardboard-Sandwich-Boxes-1.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_imag